# This folder is a workspace, not a project - each project has its own repository.
# If a repository is ever started here by mistake, these lines keep secrets and local files out.
# (Only the README in _secrets is allowed through - it lists names, never values.)
_secrets/*
!_secrets/README.md
00_Shared/_secrets/*
!00_Shared/_secrets/README.md
node_modules/
.env
*.env
.DS_Store
